The Decky Loader plugin in decky/ is based on the Decky plugin template and
keeps its own BSD 3-Clause license (see decky/LICENSE).

The SPIR-V shaders embedded in the library are compiled from the project's own
GLSL sources in shaders/ (glslangValidator is a build tool, not part of the
library).

The library links the GCC C++ runtime (libstdc++) and libgcc statically
(version 11.4, GPL-3.0 with the GCC Runtime Library Exception).
